    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FOR SALE 3 LISMORE PARK, WATERFORD X91 N56F\r\n\r\nHutchinson Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market 3 Lismore Park, Waterford, a three-bedroom semi-detached property ideally located in this established and mature residential development.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation extending to approximately 89 mts.sq., together with a garage and excellent off-street parking.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, the accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, kitchen, dining room, living room and shower room, while upstairs there are three bedrooms, a family bathroom and landing area.\r\n\r\nThe home retains a number of attractive traditional features, including two open fireplaces, adding character and warmth to the living accommodation. Heating is provided by oil-fired central heating, while the property also benefits from double-glazed windows.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is particularly appealing, with a carport to the front, private off-street parking and mature gardens, providing excellent outdoor space for families, gardening enthusiasts or those looking for a property with established surroundings. The attached garage provides valuable additional storage or potential for a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nLismore Park is a popular residential location within easy reach of Waterford City and with an extensive range of schools, shops, services and amenities. The property is also well positioned for access to local transport links and surrounding areas. The I.D.A., SETU, SETU arena are all within easy reach. \r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from some modernisation, it offers purchasers an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious three-bedroom home in an established residential setting, with generous outside space and plenty of potential to create a wonderful family home.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\n* Three-bedroom semi-detached house\r\n* Approx. 94.6 sq. m. / 1,018 sq. ft.\r\n* Oil-fired central heating\r\n* Double-glazed windows\r\n* Two open fireplaces\r\n* Garage\r\n* Carport to front\r\n* Off-street parking\r\n* Mature gardens\r\n* Established residential location\r\n* Excellent potential for modernisation\r\n* Alarm\r\n* 2 bathrooms\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment through Hutchinson Auctioneers."
      },
